  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven equation: 151 ÷ 3 + 168 × 8 − 145 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n151 ÷ 3 + 168 × 8 − 145 = ? ⇒ 151 × 3 − 168 ÷ 8 + 145 = ?\n\n⇒ 151 × 3 − __**168 **____**÷**____** 8**__ + 145 = ?\n\n⇒ __**151 ×**____** 3**__ − 21 + 145 = ?\n\n⇒ __**453**____** + 145**__ − 21 = ?\n\n⇒ __**598**____** − 21**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 577 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
